                "Value": {
                  "StringWithMarkup": [
                    {
                      "String": "Control of downy mildews in vines, hops, lettuce, onions, spinach, brassicas, oilseed, rape, tobacco, and ornamentals; rusts in currants, berry fruit, plums, vegetables, and ornamentals (especially carnations and chrysanthemums); red fire disease on vines; potato and tomato blights; leaf spot diseases on currants, berry fruit, olives, and celery; anthracnose on beans, vines, and citrus fruit; scab on apples and pears; shot-hole on stone fruit; Cercospora on bananas; tulip fire; Botrytis; needle cast in forestry; etc."
