          {
            "TOCHeading": "Transport Information",
            "Description": "Transport information lists the U.S. Department of Transportation (DOT) requirements and related information for shipping and transporting of hazardous chemical(s) by road, air, rail, or sea.",
            "URL": "https://www.phmsa.dot.gov/hazmat/erg/emergency-response-guidebook-erg",
            "Section": [
              {
                "TOCHeading": "Shipment Methods and Regulations",
                "Description": "Shipment methods and regulations of this compound.  The information in this section includes the U.S. Hazardous Materials Regulations (49 CFR Subchapter C), the International Air Transport Association (IATA) Dangerous Goods Regulations, the International Maritime Dangerous Goods (IMDG) Code, and other regulations.",
                "URL": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/CFR-2009-title49-vol2/pdf/CFR-2009-title49-vol2-part171.pdf",
                "Information": [
                  {
                    "ReferenceNumber": 24,
                    "Description": "PEER REVIEWED",
                    "Reference": [
