                    ],
                    "Value": {
                      "StringWithMarkup": [
                        {
                          "String": "/SIGNS AND SYMPTOMS/ Farm workers who were repeatedly exposed to zineb, in fields sprayed with 0.5% suspension of the fungicide, reported severe and extensive contact dermatitis ...",
