                    "Value": {
                      "StringWithMarkup": [
                        {
                          "String": "/LABORATORY ANIMALS: Acute Exposure/ Following a large /oral dose of 7-9 mg/kg/ rats and mice showed ataxia and hyperactivity followed by inactivity, loss of muscular tone, and alopecia. Most deaths occurred within 1 to 2 days. The compound is not significantly irritating to the mucosa of the rabbit eye."
                        }
                      ]
