                    ],
                    "Value": {
                      "StringWithMarkup": [
                        {
                          "String": "/AQUATIC SPECIES/ The dithiocarbamate fungicides sodium diethyldithiocarbamate, Dithane M-45, and Zineb were teratogenic to Lymnaea luteola (freshwater snail) at very low concentration. The concentration inducing 100% teratogenesis were < 10 ppm for Zineb. Swollen balloon like embryos resulted from these treatments.",
                          "Markup": [
