                      "(2) Petrosini G et al; Notiz Mal Piante 65: 9-23 (1963)",
                      "(3) Iley JR, Fiskell JGA; Proc Soil Crop Sci Soc Florida 23: 50-61 (1963)",
                      "(4) Sanborn JR et al; The Degradation Of Selected Pesticides In Soil: A Review Of Published Literature USEPA-600/9-77-022 (1977)",
