                      "(6) Bontoyan WR, Looker JB; J Agric Food Chem 21: 338-41 (1973)",
                      "(7) Ripley BD, Simpson CM; Pestic Sci 8: 487-91 (1977)"
                    ],
                    "ExtendedReference": [
